        "original_id": "9a2f7846-c9d7-5cd4-af0c-9a935b26db7f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gérald Genta, Florentine Ariosto Jones\n- Companies: International Watch Company (IWC), Universal Genève, Patek Philippe, Audemars Piguet\n- Places: Schaffhausen, Switzerland\n- Roles: jewellery designer, watchmaker\n- Products: timepieces, luxury watches\n\nFacts:\n- In 1868, American watchmaker Florentine Ariosto Jones founded International Watch Co. in Schaffhausen, Switzerland.\n- International Watch Co., also known as IWC, is a luxury Swiss watch manufacturer.\n- Charles Gérald Genta lived from 1931 to 2011.\n- Gérald Genta was a Swiss jewellery designer.\n- Gérald Genta was noted for his eponymous line of timepieces.\n- Gérald Genta also designed watches for firms including IWC, Universal Genève, Patek Philippe, and Audemars Piguet.",
